{"id":"2475ebef3d0d5886","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map.md","title":"Real-Valued Lower Semicontinuous Map","display":"df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map — Real-Valued Lower Semicontinuous Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map — Real-Valued Lower Semicontinuous Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map — Real-Valued Lower Semicontinuous Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map-—-ZFC-Topo8-Lower-Semicontinuous-Map\">df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map — ZFC Topo8 Lower Semicontinuous Map</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,\\tau,r\">\\(f,X,\\tau,r\\)</span> (topological parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8LowerSemicontinuousMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8LowerSemicontinuousMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}lower\\text{-}semicontinuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8LowerSemicontinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:f(x)&gt;r\\}\\in\\tau\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}lower\\text{-}semicontinuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8LowerSemicontinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:f(x)&gt;r\\}\\in\\tau\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The strict superlevel-set condition has the correct direction for lower semicontinuity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map-—-ZFC-Topo8-Lower-Semicontinuous-Map","text":"df-zfc-topo8-lower-semicontinuous-map — ZFC Topo8 Lower Semicontinuous Map","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locat